  "Drink the first fully, honoring what that line taught you.": "Drink de eerste volledig, eerbiedigend wat die regel je leerde.",
  "Drink the second slowly, feeling the chosen line arrive.": "Drink de tweede langzaam, voelend dat de gekozen regel arriveert.",
  "Drink water slowly and name three things you choose today.": "Drink langzaam water en noem drie dingen die je vandaag kiest.",
