  "Emergent tissue feedback, read live; real-time closed-loop cellular sensing; metabolic dynamics steered from outside; the seamless translation between digital information architecture, AI neural weights and living wetware.": "Emergent weefselfeedback, live gelezen; real-time gesloten-lus celmeting; metabole dynamiek gestuurd van buitenaf; naadloze vertaling tussen digitale informatie-architectuur, AI-neurale gewichten en levende wetware.",
  "Emotion": "Emotie",
  "Emotion is the carrier wave; thought merely rides upon it.": "Emotie is de draggolf; gedacht rijdt er slechts op mee.",
